# Rockburst build phases

Default first slice: **Phase 0 + Phase 1 only** (scaffold, CSV extract/audit, physics tests, one-row CLI). No baselines, agents, LangGraph, or Gemini until the user asks for a later phase.

| Phase | Do | Do not |
|-------|----|--------|
| 0 | package, configs, seeds, `.env.example`, pytest smoke | ML / agents |
| 1 | PDF→CSV, audit, formula tests | train models |
| 2+ | only when user requests that phase | — |

Later-phase LLM: Gemini Flash / Flash-Lite for planning/routing only; all numbers via deterministic Python tools.
